  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.37 Operation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.37 “Operation” means control of the processes and equipment that make up the water system. The term includes but is not limited to financial and personnel management, record keeping, laboratory control, process control, safety, and emergency operation planning.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; renumbered by #13289 (formerly Env-Dw 1402.35); ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
